    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ほとり",
    "text": "「笹とか短冊とか、飾りつけたらお終いッスからね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ほとり",
    "text": "「逆に楽でいいってことで、商店街とかが客寄せのために便利に七夕を活用して、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ほとり",
    "text": "「それで日本に定着したとこがあるッスから。飾って、お終い、ってのが基本ッス」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 59,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ほとり",
    "text": "「何もやることないのは楽ちんで、あたしは好みッスけどね〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
